{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I set out to make a puzzle game but I kept adding more and more stuff I like until this popped out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm not really a story or lore kinda guy, so there's none of that here. You're just a little round guy exploring a colourful world, solving <strong>81 logic puzzles</strong> across <strong>9 interconnected zones</strong>, collecting stuff, and unlocking new abilities as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's puzzle-first, but there's plenty to do between puzzles too. <strong>Navigate the entire world seamlessly with no loading screens</strong> - lots to explore and a few secrets to find if you're the curious type.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding Secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you might like this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you do, but if not, thanks for checking it out anyway!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Orb Locator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947110/3ba64f05ae3791e8aaac2db5396d33cf9b519773.jpg"},{"name":"Orb Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947110/92f7b383836cecee64151c8e90daa085d655cfca.jpg"},{"name":"Orb Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947110/a4a52d2cf6fa37984d77be0e494d275e4d419071.jpg"},{"name":"Orb Finder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947110/fa8d4a73889d21542985f1ea95123ff5b8bbf651.jpg"},{"name":"Orb Gatherer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947110/da61ed3b05716d699d05bca061b0ea2296dc74e4.jpg"},{"name":"Orb